{"id": "idaho-1", "headline": "Trial set for March in fatal Nampa DUI crash", "source": "KIVI-TV", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/nampa/march-trial-set-for-woman-charged-in-crash-that-killed-19-year-old-mother-newborn", "published": "2026-11-25", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["A trial date has been set for Abigail Nicole Wolverton, charged in an Aug. 31 crash in Nampa that killed a 19-year-old mother and her newborn daughter. She appeared in Canyon County court on Tuesday, and her trial is set to begin March 1, 2027. Wolverton faces two counts of aggravated vehicular manslaughter and one count of injury to a child. The crash happened at Middleton Road and Lake Lowell Avenue. Kyara Engelhart, 19, was eight months pregnant and was seriously hurt. Doctors delivered the baby by emergency C-section. Engelhart died Sept. 3 and her daughter, Maelynn Lindauer, died Sept. 7. Wolverton is held on a $2 million bond. Source: KIVI-TV."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110001111101111010101000111001111111", "10000010110001111100001000111010001000001", "10111010000101010111011010110001101011101", "10111010110110111000101101110110101011101", "10111010011000010110010101000111001011101", "10000010111011011000110001110100101000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000011000010000011000111010000000000", "11111011100111110100101011110100110101010", "10011000111100001001110101001111101111011", "10000011111000010010100010110000011100000", "10100000010100110001110110110000101111001", "00010111110010000011001011110100100001110", "10110100001000111000100101001001011110101", "01000011110111100101011010110110100110000", "11100001010100101001110100111000101100010", "11111110000111100101000101101101110100100", "11010100001101001111100101001111111110001", "10000111010001111100001011111010111100000", "10011000111001000111111000111000000111000", "10110010101100111000101011100101000001110", "01100000011010010110001100101111011011101", "00101111010000111100111000011100001011000",